faqs:
  - q: Do we keep our own cloud accounts?
    a: Yes. We operate inside your accounts with scoped access. No lock-in and no handoff drama when the arrangement ends.
  - q: What are typical SLAs?
    a: Response times vary by priority. P1 under 15 minutes. P2 under 1 hour. P3 under 4 business hours. Written into the statement of work.
  - q: Can you reduce our cloud bill?
    a: Typical first-quarter savings are 15 to 30 percent. We only book the savings we can actually measure.
  - q: What if we are multi-cloud?
    a: Common. We design the runbooks and tooling around where the workloads live, not a preferred vendor.
